WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.397 --> 00:00:03.920
Unit fifteen. Simple Directions!

2
00:00:04.944 --> 00:00:10.491
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Sophea. Welcome back!

3
00:00:10.541 --> 00:00:14.164
Hi, Teacher Sophea! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.214 --> 00:00:18.625
Today we learn: Simple Directions. Let's go!

5
00:00:20.090 --> 00:00:23.424
Left. Say it with me. Left!

6
00:00:26.917 --> 00:00:30.351
Right. Say it with me. Right!

7
00:00:33.876 --> 00:00:37.376
Straight. Say it with me. Straight!

8
00:00:40.879 --> 00:00:44.212
Turn. Say it with me. Turn!

9
00:00:47.715 --> 00:00:51.748
Next to. Say it with me. Next to!

10
00:00:55.249 --> 00:00:59.516
Between. Say it with me. Between!

11
00:01:03.004 --> 00:01:06.570
North. Say it with me. North!

12
00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:13.669
South. Say it with me. South!

13
00:01:17.167 --> 00:01:20.401
East. Say it with me. East!

14
00:01:23.905 --> 00:01:27.405
West. Say it with me. West!

15
00:01:30.903 --> 00:01:34.970
Roundabout. Say it with me. Roundabout!

16
00:01:38.472 --> 00:01:42.772
Signpost. Say it with me. Signpost!

17
00:01:46.276 --> 00:01:57.616
Grammar time! Imperatives for directions. Listen. Turn left. Go straight. Turn right at the corner.

18
00:01:57.666 --> 00:02:04.865
Your turn. Say it with me. Turn left. Go straight. Turn right at the corner.

19
00:02:09.695 --> 00:02:15.547
Turn left, then go straight. The school is next to the market, between the bank and the park.

20
00:02:15.597 --> 00:02:16.883
I like this story!

21
00:02:17.729 --> 00:02:23.065
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:23.115 --> 00:02:24.265
Straight!

23
00:02:25.129 --> 00:02:30.489
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:30.539 --> 00:02:31.689
North!

25
00:02:32.529 --> 00:02:40.664
Think and answer. Give directions from your house to your school.

26
00:02:40.714 --> 00:02:41.864
Great answer!

27
00:02:42.897 --> 00:02:45.678
This unit's value is Helpfulness.

28
00:02:45.728 --> 00:02:47.576
I can show helpfulness every day!

29
00:02:48.292 --> 00:02:52.743
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

30
00:02:52.793 --> 00:02:54.420
Bye-bye, friends!

